OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre to be turned into
OL,4,Agiant art canvas
OL,5,
OL,6,FLater this month, hundreds of people
OL,7,Fwill be invited to turn a shopping
OL,8,Fcentre into one giant canvas to help
OL,9,Fcelebrate their city.
OL,11,FThe Mander Centre in Wolverhampton will
OL,12,Fhost a three-day celebration of drawing
OL,13,Fbetween 27 and 29 October as part of a
OL,14,Fcollaboration between the University of
OL,15,FWolverhampton and The Big Draw.
OL,17,FThe Big Draw is an annual international
OL,18,Fcelebration that has reached more than
OL,19,Ffive million people, in more than 35
OL,20,Fcountries, since launching in 2000.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
