OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre to be turned into
OL,4,Agiant art canvas
OL,5,
OL,6,FLed by practitioners from Fine Art and
OL,7,FIllustration within the university's
OL,8,FSchool of Creative Industries, people
OL,9,Fwill work together to create an
OL,10,Fevolving large-scale drawing inspired
OL,11,Fby Wolverhampton.
